id: time-zones/offset/0056
area: time-zones
op: GetOffsetNanosecondsFor
in: str:"Australia/Sydney" bigint:8640000000000000000000
out: value: f64:0x42C05EF39B200000
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: row Z4: Broiler.JS reads only the TZif data block and keeps the offset of the last transition of 2037 for every later instant, so northern zones stay on standard time and southern ones on daylight time, where SJL-D-20 continues the recurring rules without limit; policy difference under SJL-D-20 (extrapolation), answered by SJL-8.6
